<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Allied Holdings raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Allied Holdings raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said analyst Anthony Gallo raised Allied Holdings Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/4 to 8-7/8.</p>
</text>
